 Reson8 is a studio-grade strobe tuner that measures to a tenth of a cent:
 strobe gauge, spectrum display and intonation-drift analysis for guitar,
 bass and ukulele (including polyphonic strum detection), brass and
 woodwinds, drums, and the full professional piano suite with measured
 inharmonicity and Railsback curves.
